      "scope": "One parent mailbox and two rounds. The participant copies sync_op0 after the acquire and the relaxed flag reset, and sends upward only after that copy; the next payload waits for that send. The same non-waiting flag in a later round is not round identity. A third-party sample does not consume the mailbox. republish is a cohort/reuse premise failure, not the participant protocol. Cohort changes beyond this premise and native scheduling are not proved."
